e","position":[-2288,-128],"parameters":{"width":592,"height":704,"content":"## AI Candidate Resume Screening & Tracker Pipeline\n\n### How It Works\n* **Email Trigger:** Polls Gmail every minute for incoming emails containing resume attachments (`.pdf`, `.doc`, `.docx`).\n* **Document Extraction:** Downloads attachments, sends them to Parseur for OCR extraction, and retrieves parsed candidate fields (Name, Email, Phone, Experience, Skills).\n\n\n### Setup Checklist\n1. **Gmail Trigger:** Ensure credentials are connected and filters target candidate inbox queries.\n2. **Parseur API:** Set `parserId` (`200661`) and API headers in HTTP nodes.\n3. **Groq Model:** Verify API credentials for `Groq LLM (Scoring Model)`.\n4. **Google Drive & Sheets:** Set destination root folder for uploads and sheet/document ID for `Log Candidate to Tracker Sheet`.\n\n### Customization\n* **Scoring Prompt:** Edit prompt template inside `AI Fit Score Generator` to adjust evaluation criteria or add custom requirements.\n* **Polling Interval:** Adjust check frequency in `New Resume Email Trigger` based on application volume."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"5f11afa6-c089-498d-abe9-4b45a30a4ca4","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-1632,-112],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":672,"height":512,"content":"## 1. Document Ingestion & Extraction\n* **New Resume Email Trigger:** Listens for candidate emails with document attachments.\n* **Fetch Email & Attachment:** Downloads attachments from the target email.\n"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"f2df9200-7d7c-4011-9b29-b7244e1a9fe4","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-928,-112],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":1440,"height":512,"content":"## 2. Validation & AI Candidate Scoring\n* **Check Candidate Name:** Routes incomplete or empty extractions to a Skip branch.\n* **Generate Filename:** Formats standardized file naming conventions (`CandidateName_Position`).\n* **AI Fit Score Generator:** Evaluates candidate profile against the applied role using Groq LLM to return a strict 1-10 rating."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"c76acf13-b72b-4b02-a419-ef8b45a9c74b","name":"Sticky Note3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[544,-112],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":784,"height":512,"content":"## 3. Storage & Candidate Logging\n* **Download & Upload:** Fetches raw resume and stores it safely in Google Drive.\n"},"typeVersion":1}],"active":false,"pinData":{},"settings":{"binaryMode":"separate","executionOrder":"v1"},"versionId":"6c4f7e1d-996e-4276-90d3-4fa434835e3d","nodeGroups":[],"connections":{"AI Fit Score Generator":{"main":[[{"node":"Download Original Resume File","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Send Resume to Parseur":{"main":[[{"node":"Wait for Parseur Processing","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Fetch Email & Attachment":{"main":[[{"node":"Send Resume to Parseur","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Groq LLM (Scoring Model)":{"ai_languageModel":[[{"node":"AI Fit Score Generator","type":"ai_languageModel","index":0}]]},"New Resume Email Trigger":{"main":[[{"node":"Fetch Email & Attachment","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Check Candidate Name Exists":{"main":[[{"node":"Generate Filename & Document ID","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Skip - Invalid/Empty Extraction","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Wait for Parseur Processing":{"main":[[{"node":"Get Parsed Document Metadata","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Get Extracted Candidate Data":{"main":[[{"node":"Check Candidate Name Exists","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Get Parsed Document Metadata":{"main":[[{"node":"Get Extracted Candidate Data","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Download Original Resume File":{"main":[[{"node":"Upload Resume to Google Drive","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Upload Resume to Google Drive":{"main":[[{"node":"Log Candidate to Tracker Sheet","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Generate Filename & Document ID":{"main":[[{"node":"AI Fit Score Generator","type":"main","index":0}]]}}}